---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Editorial Policy - Finsiva" description="Finsiva editorial policy and content guidelines for our tax calculators and guides.">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-canvas dark:bg-canvas">
    <main class="min-h-screen">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-8 dark:text-on-primary">Editorial Policy</h1>
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-5973dc0f32e7?w=1200&q=80" alt="Editorial review and fact-checking" class="mb-6 w-full rounded-lg object-cover max-h-80 sm:max-h-96" loading="lazy" />
        
        <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-6 text-body dark:text-muted">
          <p>Finsiva is committed to providing accurate, reliable, and up-to-date tax information. Our editorial policy ensures that all content meets strict quality and accuracy standards.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Content Accuracy</h2>
          <p>All tax information is thoroughly researched and reviewed against official government sources, including tax authority publications, legislation, and official guidance. We strive to present information that is current at the time of publication.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Professional Review</h2>
          <p>Content is reviewed by qualified tax professionals and subject matter experts to ensure technical accuracy and clarity. Complex topics are simplified without sacrificing precision.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Updates and Corrections</h2>
          <p>Tax laws and rates change frequently. We regularly update our content to reflect the latest changes and promptly correct any errors identified by users or reviewers.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Fact-Checking Process</h2>
          <p>Before publication, every statistic, tax rate, and rule is cross-referenced against at least one official government source. Drafts are reviewed by at least one tax professional, and any conflicting information is flagged for resolution before going live.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Source Attribution</h2>
          <p>Wherever possible, we link directly to official tax authority guidance, legislation, and government publications. This allows readers to verify claims independently and access the full legal text if needed.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Reader Corrections</h2>
          <p>We encourage users to report inaccuracies. Corrections are reviewed by our editorial team within 48 hours, and verified changes are published with a transparent correction note so readers can track updates.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>All information provided on Finsiva is for general informational purposes only and does not constitute professional tax advice. Users should consult qualified tax professionals for advice specific to their circumstances.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Related Pages</h2>
          <p>For more information, see our <a href="/privacy" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="/terms" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Terms of Service</a>, <a href="/contact" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Contact</a> page, or explore our <a href="/countries" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">country guides</a> and <a href="/blogs" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">blog</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
